type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In the GDExtension interface source files, deprecated functions are wrapped in `#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED` blocks:\r\n<img width=\"365\" height=\"216\" alt=\"{1D424D16-1CB4-49C1-81FA-98A40D43A4DA}\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2623f97-a5e9-4ee2-ac7b-22c178206155\" />\r\n<img width=\"494\" height=\"226\" alt=\"{E5D0DBB6-47DA-487F-848D-09D76507A822}\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2f6ab6e-7ac3-4740-91d0-e64b035a5b01\" />\r\n\r\nHowever, the generated `gdextension_interface.gen.h` only marks them as deprecated in comments, without preprocessor guards. This inconsistency means extension authors cannot completely disable deprecated APIs at compile time.\r\n\r\nAfter this change:\r\n<img width=\"861\" height=\"310\" alt=\"{5DCABB64-3C9D-4E89-A6A4-3A9AF5CBB828}\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ae2e375-2fc0-490c-a74d-ad384f81c8a7\" />\r\n<img width=\"1117\" height=\"70\" alt=\"{B07568BE-7943-415A-838E-0DC42D3196AA}\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46196024-ef8a-444b-89d3-0b998ce49967\" />\r\n\r\n@dsnopek ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-25T01:43:39Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T01:25:11Z","closed_at":"2025-11-2